                  <li>134 newsletter posts, including 41 long-form essays (about 50,000 words), hidden behind a paywall</li>
                  <li>Podcast episodes that required manual site updates, plus offers scattered across outside platforms</li>
                  <li>Business email running on the same domain, which could not be disrupted during the switch</li>
