            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="case-section">
            <h3>Context</h3>
            <p>Search is no longer just Google's blue links. Buyers now ask AI assistants and read AI-generated answers, so a site has to be readable by search engines (SEO), answer engines (AEO), and generative AI tools (GEO). Our custom-coded site had strong content, but Google Search Console showed only 3 pages indexed, mobile performance lagged, and blog posts lived as code files that required a developer workflow to publish.</p>
            <p class="context-impact">Good content that search engines and AI tools can't find, or that the team can't easily update, does not generate leads.</p>
          </div>

          <div class="expandable-section">
            <button class="expand-toggle" aria-expanded="false">
